{"unit_id":"m1khal3v__dsh-openrouter-sync-models#card-zh","repo":"m1khal3v/dsh-openrouter-sync-models","commit":"e147a0db5280b5cdacce6316bbd76fb3b650fd43","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-openrouter-sync-models 是面向 DSH Web、桌面和命令行环境的 OpenRouter 模型目录同步插件。它通过 DSH 的 LLM 路由发现 OpenRouter 配置，从凭据服务取得访问令牌，读取 OpenRouter 目录并把筛选后的模型列表写回活动 profile。插件可纳入账户预设模型，按工具调用、文本输出、聊天端点、上下文长度、价格和过期时间筛选，并映射模型容量、输入模态与推理能力。它适合希望让 DSH 的 OpenRouter 模型清单自动保持更新的用户；需要配置 OpenRouter 凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:100-107","src/sync.ts:251-305","src/models.ts:98-112","src/models.ts:204-260"]}
{"unit_id":"m1khal3v__dsh-openrouter-sync-models#card-en","repo":"m1khal3v/dsh-openrouter-sync-models","commit":"e147a0db5280b5cdacce6316bbd76fb3b650fd43","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-openrouter-sync-models keeps DSH's OpenRouter model list current. It fetches the catalog, filters usable entries, and updates profile settings. Account presets and model capability mapping are supported. It suits OpenRouter users seeking automatic refresh and requires an OpenRouter credential.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:100-107","src/sync.ts:251-305","src/models.ts:98-112","src/models.ts:204-260"]}
